From 4f1e38c1aa191957f09ddfd27c446d19c01f56bc Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Kamil Lulko <kamil.lulko@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 24 Jul 2026 21:35:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] configure: support shared libraries on uClinux

The canonical system name for Buildroot's ARM FDPIC toolchain is
"uclinuxfdpiceabi".  The shared-library configuration recognizes Linux
but, unlike several other platform checks in ncurses, does not recognize
uClinux.  It consequently leaves CC_SHARED_OPTS set to "unknown" and
rejects a shared-only Buildroot configuration.

Treat uClinux like Linux when selecting the compiler and linker options
for shared libraries.

Upstream: not submitted
Signed-off-by: Kamil Lulko <kamil.lulko@gmail.com>
---
 aclocal.m4 | 2 +-
 configure  | 2 +-
 2 files changed, 2 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/aclocal.m4 b/aclocal.m4
index 8bb0a41e..c169ce2b 100644
--- a/aclocal.m4
+++ b/aclocal.m4
@@ -7843,7 +7843,7 @@ CF_EOF
 		fi
 		cf_cv_rm_so_locs=yes
 		;;
-	(linux*|gnu*|k*bsd*-gnu)
+	(linux*|uclinux*|gnu*|k*bsd*-gnu)
 		if test "$DFT_LWR_MODEL" = "shared" && test -n "$LD_RPATH_OPT" ; then
 			LOCAL_LDFLAGS="${LD_RPATH_OPT}\$(LOCAL_LIBDIR)"
 			LOCAL_LDFLAGS2="$LOCAL_LDFLAGS"
diff --git a/configure b/configure
index bf789d81..f958a163 100755
--- a/configure
+++ b/configure
@@ -7123,7 +7123,7 @@ CF_EOF
 		fi
 		cf_cv_rm_so_locs=yes
 		;;
-	(linux*|gnu*|k*bsd*-gnu)
+	(linux*|uclinux*|gnu*|k*bsd*-gnu)
 		if test "$DFT_LWR_MODEL" = "shared" && test -n "$LD_RPATH_OPT" ; then
 			LOCAL_LDFLAGS="${LD_RPATH_OPT}\$(LOCAL_LIBDIR)"
 			LOCAL_LDFLAGS2="$LOCAL_LDFLAGS"
-- 
